ASSISTANT: We specialize in camel rides in Agadir, Morocco. We offer three unique experiences:

1. Camel Ride at Sunset: A 2-hour ride with a professional guide, crossing the Aghroud Bensergao village, and stopping at the Souss Massa River mouth for birdwatching and sunset photography.

2. Camel Ride and Barbecue Dinner: A 3-hour ride followed by a traditional Moroccan barbecue dinner prepared by our family chef.

3. Camel Ride with Couscous: A 3-hour ride with a traditional Moroccan couscous meal prepared by our family chef.

All of our experiences include hotel pickup and drop-off within Agadir city centre and coast, as well as bottled water and other refreshments.

